  {"type":"vocab_choice","content":"以下哪个词的意思是矿泉水？","options":[{"text":"air mineral","is_correct":true},{"text":"air panas","is_correct":false},{"text":"air laut","is_correct":false},{"text":"air hujan","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"air mineral 是矿泉水，air 意为水，mineral 意为矿物质的。"},
